{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c949fdb24aab4060a7b34ffb9793807533e8301d66af3fcd0bb5160830c44b1b", "ja": "（千早プロデュースの服が完成した。千早は\nみんなの感想を聞きに行ったが……）", "zh": "（千早亲自参与制作的服装完成了。千早去找大家听听感想，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1001_p", "source_sha256": "896db614d93833b9a2a00a174d588c4a04569a8c4f002673667a5217364679f4", "ja": "どうだった？　みんなの反応は。", "zh": "怎么样？大家的反应如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "2bead16d8490405e817864e2b879c71692490a10ef12a79665dcdb3ffb7289ed", "ja": "みんな、すごく褒めてくれました。\nとても綺麗で、素敵だって。", "zh": "大家都夸我了。\n说特别漂亮、特别棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "9d473f4e3a3b1234bb8da92ef6c21b9f10f15bfd30ea33bfdbb8900df4388654", "ja": "それに「新鮮な感じがする」とも言われました。\nギャップがすごいって……。", "zh": "而且他们还说“感觉很新鲜”。  \n说反差很大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f81b830b1fc7efe62d432314e911ca3eb1a24bd2afd373eb83363a2309be68fc", "ja": "わかるよ。普段とは印象が違うもんな。\n……あ、普段が悪いって言ってるわけじゃないぞ？", "zh": "我懂。和你平时给人的印象不一样嘛。\n……啊，我可不是说你平时不好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "d6cbb93afc54d0dfe5bfcdee9eecbc4174c789931ba3f6ea1aac2affcb04bb11", "ja": "ふふ、大丈夫ですよ。自覚はありますから。\n私のイメージからは、少し離れたデザインだって。", "zh": "呵呵，没关系。我还是有自知之明的。\n这个设计确实和我的形象有些不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "de150ceec460998c1993154a63c3276127a915dcb26514f3540eb9cf2c7646f7", "ja": "いつもどおりなら、もっと無難に……それこそ、\n普段着と変わらない感じになっていたと思います。", "zh": "如果按照平时的风格，应该会更稳妥一些……甚至会变得和便服没什么区别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3fee743f32f2123245f54b40d635d3ea47bd663f13430f4a60c24630459c64b8", "ja": "でも、今回は個性をしっかり出したよな。\nなにか、思うところがあったのか？", "zh": "不过，这次确实充分展现出个性了呢。是有什么特别的想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "2efa25020bc3eb15881b4fda423be8c4e438f3c2779ab41f3aaf97674f26994a", "ja": "そうですね……デザイナーさんにいろいろ提案されて、\n最初は正直、困って、ずっと迷っていたんです。", "zh": "是啊……设计师给我提了各种各样的建议，起初说实话，我很为难，一直犹豫不决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "c81b36a8cf997759f13b4fe49100411dca2ae6ff2ddc31026e78e1c9dcba9d2a", "ja": "自分のセンスに自信もなかったですから。それで、\n{$P$}を連れまわしたりもして……。", "zh": "因为我对自己的品味也没有信心。所以，还把{$P$}带着到处跑……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4d4653ae9d6b553eb61b0ac546b48872328edb191c0e0cafd68300eecc60f5eb", "ja": "ああ、色んなショップに行ってみたよな。\n参考になればと思って、全然気にしてなかったけど。", "zh": "是啊，我们去过不少店呢。我想着或许能给你提供参考，完全没觉得麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "06a25586c245d91bd698a14825aa79728496f3df0f440278b05e46291b741a65", "ja": "ありがとうございます。おかげで、視界が拓けて……\n一つの答えに辿り着けたんです。", "zh": "谢谢您。多亏了您，我的视野开阔了……\n也终于找到了一个答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "2d7f61b1d11a73eaeea2c2e4beb21f536ddd22af5047d0f4b5dd727640f744f0", "ja": "もしかしたら、難しく考えすぎなのかも……。\n服作りも、歌と同じなんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "我或许是想得太复杂了……\n做衣服这件事，说不定和唱歌是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7b65d1daf0e38b891e49cfee54fe5b95412d90ea33b1d7ed7d0e79e7f4f550f8", "ja": "歌と？", "zh": "和唱歌一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "2fe4b38b566863fd4c4180be694accd556d000244a2e1bb0212fd50aefadaa6f", "ja": "はい。歌は、上手いとか、下手とかじゃない……\n一番大事なのは、自分が歌いたいという気持ちです。", "zh": "是的。唱歌不是唱得好不好……\n最重要的是，自己想要唱歌的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "d220336c882093639c187c3b5706a2c18d23d057d5dbeae92188eb5f43157643", "ja": "服も同じで。『自分がこれを着たい』と思う気持ちを\n大切にするべきかなと。", "zh": "衣服也是一样。我觉得应该珍视『自己想穿这件衣服』的那份心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7e7728deac63b6eae310a4459c46bc701e988b447ffb086f75bc9168675c58a6", "ja": "なるほど……。つまり今回は、\n千早自身の直観を信じて作ったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，这次是相信千早自己的直觉做出来的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "b405b56378826b062a8386990e8d857849ea6acc01b19f8215b3308cf0494247", "ja": "はい。私にはデザインの『正解』はわかりません。\nでも、これが『素敵』だって思えるんです。", "zh": "是的。我不知道设计的“正确答案”是什么。\n但我觉得，这样就是“很棒”的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "ba4151474880d4f2843ab4c585f513c31f35e6db4455488bd47a1c101dca84df", "ja": "他の誰でもない、自分自身の心に正直に……。\nその想いが、このデザインの決め手になりました。", "zh": "不对任何人，只忠于自己的内心……\n正是这份心意，成为了决定这套设计的关键。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0644_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "b6d47e80b36da28d3fe995ca7f8282953033ce32700e63677f340d312aa3b1a2", "ja": "歌のように自由で、感性のままに。皆さんにも、同じ\n気持ちでこの服を選んでもらえたら、嬉しいですね。", "zh": "像歌声一样自由，遵循自己的感性。如果大家也能怀着同样的心情选择这件衣服，我会很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
